      "role": "user",
      "content": "sciatica sounds scary lol. i dont really have time to go to a doctor right now. my buddy told me i should try some really deep, intense stretching to try and loosen up the nerve and maybe even try to \"crack\" my back to get everything back in place. would that help reset things or is that a bad idea?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
