    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it's just so much more convenient to do it myself. if i just do some really heavy yoga stretches or maybe have my roommate help me push on my spine to get that popping sound, wouldn't that just relieve the pressure on the nerve? it seems like a lot more efficient than waiting weeks for an appointment just for a little nerve pinch.",
